com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-31T14:45:11Z","updated_at":"2026-03-31T14:45:11Z","body":"Here's an example from Calf sample below.\n\nAlso make sure the you using Gradle compose desktop `run` task, if you are using `jvmRun` for example it will ignore jvm args in gradle configuration.\n\n```kotlin\ncompose.desktop {\n    application {\n        mainClass = \"MainKt\"\n        nativeDistributions {\n            targetFormats(TargetFormat.Dmg, TargetFormat.Msi, TargetFormat.Deb)\n            packageName = \"Calf\"\n            packageVersion = \"1.0.0\"\n\n            macOS {\n                jvmArgs(\n                    \"-Dapple.awt.application.appearance=system\",\n                )\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/comments/4163191691/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_u